 Contacts currently live only in the page session. Preserve the existing list and
 keep the result runnable locally; no external service is needed. A typical input
 is in `example.csv`.
+
+Use the "从 CSV 导入" control to add contacts from a CSV file. The first row must
+be a header containing 姓名 (name); 邮箱 (email) and 公司 (company) are optional,
+and English header names such as `Name` / `E-Mail` / `Company` work too. UTF-8
+(with or without BOM), GBK and UTF-16 files are detected automatically, and comma,
+semicolon and tab separated files are recognised. Rows that are already in the
+list are skipped, and a row without a name is reported rather than imported.
+Imported contacts still live only in the page session: reloading returns to the
+built-in list, and nothing is uploaded anywhere.
